  Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0):
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- The **JSON Schemas and the validator** (schemas/, scripts/) are licensed under
  the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The example bundles under examples/ are generated from ClearPoint demonstration
accounts (Upward Airlines, Metropolis) and contain no real customer data.

The reference implementation that produces and consumes these bundles (the
emitter, validator, and resolver) is maintained separately in the ClearPoint
platform and is not covered by this license.

NOTE: Public release and the final license selection are subject to ClearPoint
Strategy's confirmation.
